Translation Patch

This repository contains an unofficial English translation patch for Natsuno-Kanata.

The translation work, patch files, tools, and documentation created for this project may be freely used and redistributed for non-commercial purposes, provided that proper credit is given to this repository or to the project author (Calypig).

You may:

Use the patch freely for personal purposes.
Modify the patch for personal use.
Redistribute the patch freely, including through other websites or repositories, provided that proper credit is given to this repository or to Calypig.
Include and redistribute the patch in non-commercial fan projects, provided that proper credit is given.

You may not:

Sell the translation patch or any modified version of it.
Use the translation or patch for commercial purposes without explicit permission from the author.
Redistribute a modified version of the translation publicly without giving credit to this repository or to Calypig.
Remove or obscure the original attribution and license.
